Architecture diagram skill

Install:
  Install and validate the missing Archify skill; prepare Node.js/pnpm and Git as needed.

Upgrade:
  Back up and replace the installed Archify skill and run its CLI doctor; restore previous skill files if validation fails.

Status:
  Report skill locations based on SKILL.md presence, and the Node.js command location and version; run the installed CLI doctor with update checks disabled.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/archify
  Existing copies at ${CODEX_HOME:-$HOME/.codex}/skills/archify are consolidated into links to the destination when skill files are replaced.
